      "slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "title": "Agent Output Is Not UX: Rendering Layer Your LLM Pipeline Is Missing",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI",
      "track": "",
      "day": null,
      "room": null,
      "is_sole_speaker": true
    }
  ],
  "sessions": [],
  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "The model did the real work, but look at the outcome. I have to do my research and work towards actually booking the table.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=1s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The only thing that you need to focus on is the layer between the model and something that a human can interact with.",
      "timestamp_sec": 45,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=45s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "none of these problems are due to the model itself. The model does its job well.",
      "timestamp_sec": 140,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=140s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "these are delivery problems and they live in between the model output and what's on the screen. That is the layer that decides whether your product succeeds or not.",
      "timestamp_sec": 140,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=140s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Instead of the agent handing you a raw text or HTML, it describes the UI as data. A list of components and the client renders them with its own native widgets.",
      "timestamp_sec": 183,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=183s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The higher you go, the more your client has to trust whatever the model hands it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 283,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=283s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "when a client meets a content type it's never seen, it doesn't gracefully degrade, it crashes. And it keeps crashing for days or weeks",
      "timestamp_sec": 325,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=325s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "So, one rule holds everything that follows for mobile clients. You cannot meaningfully patch the client.",
      "timestamp_sec": 325,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=325s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "In this example, one to three flights a swipable carousel. Four or more, a vertical list. The model picks the intent.",
      "timestamp_sec": 476,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=476s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "And notice what the model never does. It never invents a component. It chooses from a fixed menu that you provide to it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 476,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=476s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "It may take 3 to 4 seconds to get there, but the wait is bearable.",
      "timestamp_sec": 580,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=580s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "you stop chasing the total latency, which we have done for over a decade. You start chasing time to first chunk.",
      "timestamp_sec": 580,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=580s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "For this reason, the traditional loading spinner won't work for AI features.",
      "timestamp_sec": 580,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=580s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The overall AI users have moved out of the forgiving phase, and now they expect to know what is happening.",
      "timestamp_sec": 633,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=633s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Even though it takes 10 seconds, I'm okay if I know what's happening and be able to trust the agent's final output.",
      "timestamp_sec": 675,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=675s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Every rendered element carries an action payload to handle what what a tap does, what the deep link hit opens.",
      "timestamp_sec": 721,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=721s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "let the BFF absorb the model output so the client can stay dumb and safe.",
      "timestamp_sec": 776,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=776s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "No, none of these are about the model. The model was fine. This layer is what ships the product.",
      "timestamp_sec": 776,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=776s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "your agent output is not the CX. You build on it.",
      "timestamp_sec": 832,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=832s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "claim": "The bottleneck in agentic products is the rendering layer between model output and screen, not model capability.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 140,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=140s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Agents should emit typed UI intent (component blocks) rather than text or HTML.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 422,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=422s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "The model must never invent a component; it should only select from a fixed catalog supplied in its context.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 476,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=476s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Most production mobile apps should stay in the controlled or declarative tiers of generative UI, not fully open-ended generation.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 283,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=283s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Mobile clients cannot be meaningfully patched, so unknown content types cause crashes that persist for days or weeks.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 325,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=325s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Component availability must be gated by app version in the model's context (e.g. a 2.0 flight card only offered to 2.0+ clients).",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 422,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=422s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Teams should replace total latency with time to first chunk as the primary UX metric for AI features.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 580,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=580s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "claim": "Traditional loading spinners are inadequate for AI features because users no longer tolerate opaque waits.",
      "confidence": "stated",
      "timestamp_sec": 580,
      "talk_slug": "agent-output-is-not-ux-rendering-layer-your-llm-pipeline-is-missing",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=maTp79FD9gI&t=580s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
